OL,3,AUS singer D4vd's celebrity lawyers
OL,4,Awithdraw from murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe celebrity lawyers hired to
OL,7,Frepresent US musician D4vd in his
OL,8,Fupcoming murder trial have withdrawn
OL,9,Ffrom the case.
OL,11,FThe star, whose legal name is David
OL,12,FAnthony Burke, has been appointed a
OL,13,Fpublic defender to mount his defence
OL,14,Fagainst the charge of murdering Celeste
OL,15,FRivas Hernandez, 14, whose remains were
OL,16,Ffound in September 2025 in a Tesla
OL,17,Fregistered to his address.
OL,19,FBurke, 21, pleaded not guilty to the
OL,20,Fmurder charges in a Los Angeles court
OL,21,Fon Monday.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
