OL,3,AUS singer D4vd's celebrity lawyers
OL,4,Awithdraw from murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge determined last month that he
OL,7,Fwill stand trial for murder.
OL,8,FProsecutors have alleged he stabbed the
OL,9,Fteen after years of sexual abuse before
OL,10,Fdismembering her body.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
