OL,5,G2100 The Blues Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,6,     FA weekly round-up of the blues you
OL,7,     Fneed to hear!
OL,8,G2200 The Good Groove with Melvin Odoom
OL,9,     FFeelgood tunes to groove and
OL,10,     Fsoothe your soul. Tonight Melvin
OL,11,     Fplays tunes that are all five
OL,12,     Fminutes in duration or longer.
OL,13,     FLong songs for a long weekend!
