OL,5,G2130 How Did We Get Here: No World
OL,6,G     Order
OL,7,     F6/6. Tristan Redman and guests
OL,8,     Fdiscuss the chaotic US withdrawal
OL,9,     Ffrom Afghanistan, Russia's
OL,10,     Ffull-scale invasion of Ukraine and
OL,11,     Fthe US capture of Venezuelan
OL,12,     FPresident Maduro.
OL,13,G2200 The World Tonight
OL,14,G2245 A Working Mother by Agnes Owens
OL,15,     F1/5. Ten years after the Second
OL,16,     FWorld War, Betty is married to a
OL,17,     Ftroubled veteran who barely looks
OL,18,     Fafter their two children while she
OL,19,     Fearns a wage.
